YoungSymmetrize. When that matters, gate calls behind an additional check on \
the flattened entries.\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->564012456,ExpressionUUID->"f111fcd6-f6ad-4c97-8ae9-f69c5759b002"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Invalid YoungTableau stays as a literal expression", "ExampleSubsection",
 CellID->750203801,ExpressionUUID->"1ab9ea98-ce17-4a6d-9190-b3e2f0914f3c"],

Cell["\<\
The auto-validate upvalue only fires when YoungTableauQ would accept the \
rows. A literal YoungTableau with bad rows therefore persists and \
YoungTableauQ remains False:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->327652040,ExpressionUUID->"b49a662d-c544-48d9-8d0a-7430bc167a17"],

